    "$t": "343期編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">夢想，是一時空眠夢，iah是替未來設想？隨人有無仝答案，有成功有失敗。〈心靈〉ê作者講伊beh行tī想beh行ê路頂，〈查某囡仔〉ê作者suah認為kā人sak leh行--ê，m̄是夢。〈Hit年秋天lóng無歇睏〉ê阿爸，tńg故鄉開店ê夢終其尾煞戲；〈齒科往診〉ê黃醫師，堅心做趁無錢ê往診也煩惱無人傳承。總--是，夢想是人類永遠ê追求。〈台中豐樂雕塑公園〉ê雕塑家，用創作雕像向內稽考lán人幼路ê情緒；〈Ji̍t-pún ê Thài-khong Thàm-cha-ki Ha-iá-bú-sah 2 hō〉，用先進科技向外研究宇宙闊大ê天體。Koh有人ê夢，是因為囡仔來開始，tuì〈一條台語路，一兼幾若顧〉、〈台語是按怎ē拍無--去？〉、〈囡仔kap台語〉三篇文章，做伙來看in ê台語路kap台語夢。</span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUCHfP9ZcxoO5pj47vRJ8D_G6bxhv3plnQQN-e6AaaV7unEvPASs6JtnS_YfwT_RbfUyKhnNnc91t4N0GHRtUweHrT7QqEi3hBJeU7LnLBlcNBTKNvTlMZH6fONUqYTV8-YYFIVqPLbfMjVDiifwVr7UalvYcBLsJ0zocr_JPM67l1OK6MvfPK1Ccycg/s1424/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUCHfP9ZcxoO5pj47vRJ8D_G6bxhv3plnQQN-e6AaaV7unEvPASs6JtnS_YfwT_RbfUyKhnNnc91t4N0GHRtUweHrT7QqEi3hBJeU7LnLBlcNBTKNvTlMZH6fONUqYTV8-YYFIVqPLbfMjVDiifwVr7UalvYcBLsJ0zocr_JPM67l1OK6MvfPK1Ccycg/w450-h640/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi9rzktF2kC_WW6T6yDAVYqtSMNda9HgWR5mGDGgcS_5cggEo_jHUf2eKqyfyQ9ngPQD3PLE0yQijI021DIu4uavivLYvgFUlJmPhk7_lQBn5p8zzrejwpNb0kg6ks-pm6n6kvALBXztwgMK01gt_fWAzYreh4d54Mjl6OWSgRKT3fdxoH5AmOE3_vSVQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1343%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E5%AE%A4.jpg\" 